      "message": "fix(ui): ribbon labels whole at 1280 px, group captions painted again\n\nCell labels shrink to fit (13 -> 10 px) before eliding; the four section\ndoors wear short words (Mill 2D, Mill 3D, Drill, Multi) so they no longer\nall read \"Milli...\"; group captions are painted again where they fit their\ngroup. The ground grid returns nothing for a non-finite or absurd camera\n(dist 1e308 made its line range span all of i64).\n\nFixes #948\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
